> SmartMouth makes activated two-solution oral rinses that prevent bad breath for 24 hours with two rinses a
> day, plus a fluoride toothpaste and dry mouth mints. Alcohol-free, dentist developed and recommended,
> made in the USA. Sold at smartmouth.com and in US retail. Every order is covered by the 60-Day Money-Back
> Satisfaction Guarantee.

## How SmartMouth works

Each rinse comes as two solutions that activate the moment they are mixed in the cup. Solution 1 (green cap,
the Sulfur Eliminator) contains sodium chlorite, which eliminates the volatile sulfur compounds that cause bad
breath. Solution 2 (blue cap, the Zinc Ion Activator) contains zinc chloride, which releases zinc ions that
block new sulfur gas for at least 12 hours. Pour Solution 1 to the 10 mL mark, add Solution 2 to the 20 mL
mark, swish for 30 seconds (60 seconds for the Advanced Liposomal rinses), gargle and spit. Rinse morning and
night for 24-hour prevention and no morning breath. SmartMouth calls this patented Smart-Zinc Technology.
How it works: https://smartmouth.com/pages/how-it-works

